From 85fb53da8fa5397a7474246118f6699a85972e1b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: t <tristan75015@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 15:49:58 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Kernels always compiled: MFEM_MGIS_HAVE_DEVICE_SOURCES and
 areGradientsKernelsAvailable removed

The sources containing kernels are compiled with or without a GPU, with CUDA or HIP: the definition MFEM_MGIS_HAVE_DEVICE_SOURCES was always given, and batch::areGradientsKernelsAvailable always returned true. The branches reporting kernels not compiled, the refusal of the finite elements and of the post-processings on the GPU with HIP in the execution settings, and the function are removed.
---
