 src/Batch/InnerForces.cxx                     | 15 ---
 src/Batch/IntegrationPointsFunctions.cxx      | 54 -----------
 src/Batch/StiffnessMatrices.cxx               | 91 -------------------
 src/CMakeLists.txt                            |  8 +-
 src/ExecutionSettings.cxx                     | 11 ---
 14 files changed, 5 insertions(+), 412 deletions(-)

